+When a `# fmt: skip` comment appears at the end of a line that contains multiple
+semicolon-separated statements, the entire physical line is preserved verbatim:
+
+```python
+a = 1; b = 2; c = 3  # fmt: skip
+```
+
 As such, adding an `# fmt: skip` comment at the end of an expression will have no effect. In
